  <div class="label">THE ANNOUNCEMENT</div><h2>Connect · Compute · Create · Showcase.</h2>
  <p>The conclave will be held on <strong>Friday, 5 February and Saturday, 6 February 2027</strong> at Kongu Engineering College.</p>
  <p>The programme combines industry leadership, hands-on HPC workshops, a 24-hour industry innovation challenge and an innovation showcase by KEC students and faculty.</p>
